# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; this file is not, so it must never hold a
# real value. List every variable the project reads, with a fake value that shows the shape.
#
# How the app loads it depends on the stack:
#   Node 20+:  node --env-file=.env app.js
#   Python:    python-dotenv, or export in the shell
#   .NET:      dotnet user-secrets (preferred for local dev), or environment variables
#   iOS:       do not ship secrets in the app bundle; use the Keychain or a backend
#
# {{SERVICE}}_API_KEY=sk-...
# BROKER_ACCOUNT=paper-123456      # trading: default to a paper/demo account
